('0347ab3a-6b47-4301-b213-965679ad867c', 2, 'Launch Update - April 2026',
'The launch of fan.site is getting closer every day. Here''s the latest on our timeline, the fork progress, and what''s coming next.',
$content$<p>Dear fans,</p>

<p>The launch of <strong>fan.site</strong> is getting closer every day!</p>

<p>For those who haven''t been following the journey closely: fan.site was always built as a working fork of <a href="https://dehub.io" target="_blank">DeHub''s open-source stack</a>. A group of us - part of the broader DeHub community - saw an opportunity to take that incredible foundation and tailor it specifically for the adult creator economy. That vision became fan.site.</p>

<p>Recently, DeHub underwent a significant platform upgrade - a full rebuild of their core infrastructure. Because fan.site is a downstream fork, we needed to integrate those upstream changes to stay in sync and maintain compatibility. That process took longer than expected, but it''s now <strong>fully complete and stable</strong>. All the critical blocker bugs that surfaced during the merge have been resolved over the last few weeks, and we''re incredibly proud of how solid the foundation is now.</p>

<p>Our plan remains the same: <strong>launch the app first</strong> to build real traction and community momentum. Once we hit that sweet spot - or a perfect launch window opens - we''ll activate the token with stronger backing and optimal timing. Keeping the token untraded until we had full clarity and the best possible positioning simply made the most sense.</p>

<p>The March timeline we shared earlier turned out to be a bit too optimistic. The upstream DeHub upgrade introduced about a month of additional integration work on our end, but everything''s cleared now.</p>

<p><strong>April feels like the right month.</strong> DeHub originally launched on April 20th, 2021, and there''s something poetic about that alignment. It also gives us just enough breathing room to finalize the fork properly. The end result will be two apps running on the same proven stack, in perfect sync:</p>

<ul>
<li>🔥 <strong>fan.site</strong> - tailored for adult markets (exclusive, focused, creator-first)</li>
<li>🌐 <strong>DeHub</strong> - for everything else (open, versatile, censorship-resistant media)</li>
</ul>

<p>This keeps DeHub universally accessible and on stores, while using the same stack to corner adult markets too. Thank you for your patience and unwavering support through the ups and downs - this wouldn''t be possible without you. We''re so close now, and it''s going to be worth the wait.</p>

<p>More updates soon - stay tuned, and let''s make this epic.</p>

<p><em>Much love,<br/>The fan.site Team</em></p>$content$,
'Community', ARRAY['launch','update','token','roadmap','april-2026'], true, true,
