('c9025554-e6f8-4156-93c2-78a5197f2ccb', 1, 'fan.site is coming 2026',
'fan.site will launch in 2026. While there were opportunities for an earlier release, not everything aligned as planned.',
$content$<p>fan.site will launch in 2026. While there were opportunities for an earlier release, not everything aligned as planned. We are fully committed to delivering a successful, high-quality experience for app users and investors alike, and we cannot risk wasting time, resources, or jeopardizing our network with anything subpar.</p>

<p>As many of you have seen, the team''s TikTok operations have grown tremendously - and now support over 1,200 TikTok live streamers, including many OnlyFans models, and have established themselves as one of the leading TikTok agencies worldwide, working directly with TikTok executives.</p>

<p>Our move into crypto is not a roll of the dice, a chancer''s chance or an extraction event; it represents established industry leaders bringing their expertise on-chain to create real impact as we believe in this tech and product we''re building. Since announcing the relaunch and pausing trading, holders have had the option to request a full refund at the last trading price. Very few have chosen to do so.</p>

<p>As a friendly reminder: if anyone needs liquidity now, perhaps for the holiday season, you''re welcome to reach out for an OTC sale at negotiable rates. We''d hate to see you go, but we completely understand if circumstances require it and can leave you a complimentary "moon bag" so you don''t miss out completely.</p>

<p>Thank you for your continued patience, trust, and support.</p>$content$,
'Announcements', ARRAY['launch','update','2026','crypto'], false, true,
